- Fixed macOS patch policies and patch notifications for Fleet-maintained apps and custom packages flagging a host as outdated when an older copy of the app was on a mounted installer disk image (for example, a Google Chrome DMG left open in `/Volumes`). Existing patch policies for Fleet-maintained apps pick up the fix when Fleet refreshes the app's queries. Patch policies for custom packages pick it up when a new package is added. Existing automatic-install policies keep their stored query.
